  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> 1&nbsp;foot = <strong>30.48&nbsp;cm</strong> and 1&nbsp;inch = 2.54&nbsp;cm. To convert a height, turn it into inches (feet &times; 12 + inches) and multiply by 2.54: 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;10&nbsp;in = 70&nbsp;in = <strong>177.8&nbsp;cm</strong>.</p></div>

