  <section id="formula" aria-labelledby="formula-h">
    <h2 id="formula-h">Feet and Inches to cm Formula</h2>
    <p class="tp-note" style="font-size:17px!important"><span class="tp-kbd">cm = (feet &times; 12 + inches) &times; 2.54</span><br><span class="tp-kbd">cm = feet &times; 30.48</span></p><p>Example: 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;6&nbsp;in = (5 &times; 12 + 6) &times; 2.54 = 66 &times; 2.54 = 167.64&nbsp;cm.</p>
  </section>

