  <section id="tips" aria-labelledby="tips-h">
    <h2 id="tips-h">Tips for Height Conversions</h2>
    <p>Round heights to the nearest centimeter for everyday use (177.8&nbsp;cm becomes 178&nbsp;cm). Medical records often keep one decimal place. To see what any height looks like, use the <a href="/height-comparison/">height comparison tool</a>; to see where it ranks, use the <a href="/height-percentile-calculator/">height percentile calculator</a>.</p>
